    "ChooseNonIsomorphicClqComplexes[cList_List] Given a list cList of clique \
complexes (each given as a list of maximal cliques), \
ChooseNonIsomorphicClqComplexes[cList] returns the largest list of \
non-isomorphic complexes from cList. \
ChooseNonIsomorphicClqComplexes[cmpxList] Given a sequence of lists cmpxList \
of clique complexes (each given as a list of maximal cliques), \
ChooseNonIsomorphicClqComplexes[cmpxList] returns a single list where any two \
complexes originating from different lists are non-isomorphic, but two \
complexes originating from the same list are not checked for isomorphism. \
ChooseNonIsomorphicClqComplexes[cList_List] Given a list of sublists cList of \
clique complexes (each given as a list of maximal cliques), \
ChooseNonIsomorphicClqComplexes[cList] returns a single list where any two \
complexes originating from different sublists are non-isomorphic, but two \
complexes originating from the same sublist are not checked for isomorphism.",
